         "step": 1,
         "text": "At x = 2 the numerator is 1/3 - 1/3 = 0 and the denominator is 0, so the form is zero over zero.",
         "mathjson": 0
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Combine the numerator over the common denominator 3(x + 1): 1/(x + 1) - 1/3 = (3 - (x + 1))/(3(x + 1)) = (2 - x)/(3(x + 1)).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
